    "45 度腿举机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "45° Leg Press Machine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "阿诺德推举": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arnold Press"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安排多个训练日，并为次数型动作设置目标组数和每组次数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organize workout days and set target sets and reps for rep-based exercises."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安排多个训练日，并为每个动作设置目标组数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add training days and set a target number of sets for each exercise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按点击顺序安排动作，并设置每个动作的目标组数和每组次数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose exercises in order and set target sets and reps for each one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按点击顺序安排动作，并为每个动作设置目标组数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Order exercises as you select them and set a target number of sets for each one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按动作看进步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Progress by Exercise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按功能查看帮助": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browse help by feature"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按计划出发": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stay on Schedule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按你点击的顺序生成训练动作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exercises appear in the order you select them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按想展示的顺序选择 1–4 个动作；第一个会成为海报主角。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose 1–4 exercises in the order you want to show them. The first one takes center stage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把动作做成低位划船，绳索只拉到胸口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning it into a low row and pulling the rope only to the chest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把横杆调到合适高度，双手略宽于肩握住。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the bar to a suitable height and grip it slightly wider than shoulder width."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把滑轮调到面部附近高度，双手握住绳头。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the pulley near face height and hold one rope end in each hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把绳索拉向眉眼位置，同时让双肘向外打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull the rope toward eye level while opening your elbows outward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存备注": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存更多常用动作组合，不必每次重新选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save more exercise lineups so you don't have to rebuild them each time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存后，自动开始休息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest starts after you save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存后自动进入休息倒计时。按计划完成目标组数后，继续下个动作；最后一个动作完成后自动保存训练。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saving a set starts the rest timer. Finish the planned sets, then move to the next exercise. Completing the last exercise automatically saves your workout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存提醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Reminder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存提醒时，系统会询问是否允许通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you save, the system will ask whether Liji may send notifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存为模板": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save as Template"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存一组后自动休息。计划训练最后一个动作完成后自动保存；自由训练从更多菜单结束。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest starts after saving a set. Planned workouts save after the last exercise; end free workouts from the More menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存这一组": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save this set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
