    "本版本没有广告、第三方统计 SDK 或用户追踪，也不会读取或写入 Apple 健康数据。主题与训练提醒偏好只用于在本机记住你的设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This version has no ads, third-party analytics SDKs, or user tracking. It does not read or write Apple Health data. Theme and workout reminder preferences are stored only on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
