    "点右上角 + 可以创建自己的三分化、四分化或任意循环计划。每个训练日选好动作后，首页会直接给你下一练。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the top-right button to create any custom split. Once each training day is set up, your next workout appears on the Home screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点右上角 + 可以直接创建；完成训练后也可以保存本次动作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the top-right button to create one, or save your exercise lineup from a workout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点右上角 + 可以直接创建自己的模板；完成一套训练后也可以在当前训练页保存为模板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
