          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅会通过 Apple ID 付款并自动续订。除非在当前订阅期结束至少 24 小时前取消，否则会继续续订。价格以系统购买页面显示为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Payment is charged to your Apple ID and the subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. The system purchase sheet shows your local price."
          }
        }
