        }
      }
    },
    "今天状态、动作感觉、疼痛、器械变化...": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How you felt, pain, form notes, or equipment changes..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅统计已结束的训练，按训练开始日期归属。负重训练量为重量 × 实际次数之和；自重只计附加负重，计时动作不计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only completed workouts are included, grouped by start date. Volume is weight × actual reps. Bodyweight exercises count added load only; timed exercises are excluded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅统计已结束的训练。每组归入一个主要部位，颜色表示组数，不代表肌肉激活或恢复程度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only completed workouts are counted. Each set is assigned to one primary region. Color shows set count, not muscle activation or recovery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅展示已记录的训练数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only recorded workout data is shown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
